menu "embpet proto"

    config EMBPET_PROTO_STRESS
        bool "Frame writer stress test (never enable in production)"
        default n
        help
            Two tasks each emit 1000 events while ESP_LOGW spams, three seconds
            after boot. Check on the host with
            tools/embpet_cli.py --check-frames SEC --reset.

    config EMBPET_CONSOLE_SOAK
        bool "Console soak generator (never enable in production)"
        default n
        help
            A task emits a "soak" event and a WARN log line every 100 ms and
            reports the longest event write, log write and loop period it has
            seen, so a host can show the firmware kept running while the port
            was closed. Host side: tools/console_test.py soak.

endmenu
